[qa-smoke] BLOCKED Portal frontend smoke: set one of QA_PORTAL_FRONTEND_BASE_URL, PORTAL_FRONTEND_BASE_URL; example QA_PORTAL_FRONTEND_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:4300
